    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry FitzGerald Fogarty are delighted to offer this super bungalow to the market for sale. Seffin, Birr, is located approx. six minutes' walk from Birrs Main Street. Standing on a mature and private wite with large gardens, this wonderful location is surrounded by good quality family homes, The County Arms Hotel, and Tesco Birr. This particular house was built in 1985 and it has been very carefully minded over the past number of years and offers a perfect location, a good internal layout, a private rear garden, a detached garage and a useful ground floor accommodation. With a little modernisation this can become the perfect family home. Accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a sitting room, a kitchen/dining room, a utility room, a living room, three bedrooms and a bathroom.All mains services are supplied and connected. The large gardens mean there are opportunities to extend the house and increase the accommodation subject to the necessary planning permission if required. Useful detached garage also, with front & side access. A great home in the best location, to be cherished and enjoyed. Viewings by arrangement with Julie Fogarty 0505 21192."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting room - \n\n\nKitchen - \n\n\nLiving Room - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - \n\n\nBathroom - \n\n\nGarage -"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Mains water and mains sewerage connections.</li><li>E-fibre broadband. </li><li>Large sunny gardens with plenty of room to extend.</li><li>Town centre location close to Tesco and County Arms Hotel.</li><li>Secure and private rear garden.</li><li>The detached garage could create some new accommodation.</li></ul>"
      },
